    <string name="touch_controls_edge_group">"Okuzimele · ukuvikelwa kwamaphethelo"</string>
    <string name="touch_controls_edge_summary">"U-0 uvala ukuhlunga emaphethelweni; amazinga 1–3 akhulisa ukuvikelwa ekuthinteni amaphethelo ngephutha. Ukuhlunga okunamandla kungenza ukuthinta amaphethelo ngamabomu kube nzima."</string>
    <string name="touch_controls_global_summary">"Inketho yesistimu yonke yokusabela ibekwa phambili. Amasethingi ohlelo ngalunye agciniwe kodwa amisiwe. Thepha lapha ukuze uphathe inketho yesistimu yonke."</string>
    <string name="touch_controls_global_title">"Ukweqa kokuthinta kwesistimu yonke kuyasebenza"</string>
    <string name="touch_controls_help">"Qala ngamasethingi azenzakalelayo enziwa ngesandla. Vumela ukulungisa kuphela ezinhlelweni ezikudingayo.\n\nAmasethingi asethiwe nokulungisa ngesandla kuyizindlela ezihlukile, hhayi imiphumela okufanele ihlanganiswe. Amasethingi 1–3 amaphrofayela e-firmware; awawona amazinga ekhwalithi.\n\nKumodi eyenziwa ngesandla, u-0 ubuyisela okuzenzakalelayo kwe-firmware. Amazinga aphezulu ashintsha ukuthinta futhi angazwakala kabi kweminye imidlalo. Lungisa ukusabela noma ukuzwela kuqala; sebenzisa ukukhomba nokuzinza kuphela ekulungiseni okuncane.\n\nUkuhlunga emaphethelweni kuzimele. Ukuvikelwa okunamandla kunganqaba nokuthinta ngamabomu eduze komphetho wesikrini.\n\nInketho yesistimu yonke yokusabela ibekwa phambili kunokulungisa uhlelo ngalunye. Lezi zilawuli azishintshi izinga lokuvuselela lesibonisi."</string>
